+<!-- FROM THE MAKER: written by Nimit, placed word for word. -->
+<section class="maker-section" id="story">
+  <div class="maker-inner">
+    <div class="section-label">Why Clarity exists</div>
+    <h2 class="section-title display">About my <em>mom</em></h2>
+    <img class="maker-lead" src="images/family-2.jpg" alt="My mom and me sitting together on a stone bench" loading="lazy" />
+    <div class="maker-mom">
+      <p>My Mother has been a shining light in our family, extended family and our community for as long as I’ve lived. From the library of Mater Dei High School to the aqua aerobics class at any number of LA Fitnesses, 12+ person sleepovers to pizza parties in the park, she is loved anywhere someone is lucky enough to meet her. She’s the type of person to make friends with you while you’re standing in a line, and it doesn’t even have to be that long. When my father’s colleague casually mentioned that spicy food helps induce labor, and his wife was past her due date, Mom invited them both over and made the spiciest meal I’ve ever had from her kitchen; 12 hours later, the wife was in labor.</p>
+      <p>That’s honestly just one of a million stories I could tell, but the truth is, if you knew my mom you had your own stories and cherish them as I do mine. Her warmth and kindness was only matched by a stern tone when stepping out of line. The volume of her voice is the reason why everyone in our bloodline has to be told to quiet down all the time.  Her disease may have robbed her of a lot, but the booming laughter and love she exudes will never diminish. We hope this app helps you hold onto those special parts of your loved ones as well.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="maker-gallery">
+      <img src="images/family-4.jpg" alt="My mom and me standing on a sunny beach" loading="lazy" />
+      <img src="images/family-5.jpg" alt="My mom and me in front of a lit Christmas tree at night" loading="lazy" />
+      <img src="images/family-3.jpg" alt="My mom and me outside a carved stone temple" loading="lazy" />
+      <img src="images/family-1.jpg" alt="My mom in her wheelchair with me behind her, out shopping" loading="lazy" />
+    </div>
+    <div class="maker-me">
+      <h3>About me</h3>
+      <p>I set out to create Clarity as an easy, fun, low-pressure way for my mom to exercise her mind while she deals with Frontotemporal Dementia. With the help of some AI coding tools, I was able to make something she can use every day in order to help keep her mind active. Now, I’d like to share it with as many people as possible and try to allow families to keep their loved ones as long as they can.</p>
+      <p>I have no monetary goals with this app. I never will advertise, never will sell data, and never will use this app for my own personal financial gain. I set out to help people, and  my mom would whoop my ass if I strayed from my morals.</p>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</section>
